      "id": "sol.amc-12a-2005-p5.live",
      "kind": "proof-sketch",
      "text": "The total of all \\(50\\) numbers is \\(20 \\cdot 30 + 30 \\cdot 20\\) \\(= 600 + 600\\) \\(= 1200.\\)\n\nThe average is \\(1200 \\div 50 = 24.\\)\n\nThus, the correct answer is B.",
